  "duration_s": 97.406009,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "这酒怎么喝到最后还有半瓶儿，半瓶留着下次喝，说明咱俩的局还没完。酒喝干了是散场，剩半瓶是续集。您下回还得来，你什么意思啊，怎么给我？这倒的这么满啊，酒满敬人，茶满七人给您倒满，是我对您的敬意。满到溢出来了，你什么意思？怎么最后一个敬我？第一个敬您是开场，最后一个敬，您是压轴开场热闹压轴值前，我把最值钱的位置留给自己了。小李，你这酒量不行啊，才几杯就上脸啊，酒量留给外人，真心留给您，跟您喝，不用装，怎么您你给自己倒的是茶茶陪酒，一个清醒一个醉，您醉了。有，我扶着我醉了，咱俩都趴桌上了。明早谁给您汇报这鱼，你怎么点清蒸的呢？原汁原味才最鲜，调料多了，盖住的都是食材本身。就像您看人一眼，到底不用包装，你怎么就喝这点儿养菊呢？我得留着量，万一您喝到位了，总得有个清醒的人负责掏您家门钥匙吧。哈哈，哎，你什么意思啊？怎么到我这儿就剩半杯了。领导美满，美满，代表幸福美满，这一辈子没满，就是一辈子没满啊。第一杯你不干掉，就是看不起我。领导第一杯干掉是规矩第二杯，慢慢品才是交情，把规矩做足，后面交情再慢慢聊。关注我，每天学点高情商，说话技巧，让你的路越走越宽。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 2330,
      "text": "这酒怎么喝到最后还有半瓶儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00002",
      "start_ms": 2330,
      "end_ms": 3510,
      "text": "半瓶留着下次喝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3510,
      "end_ms": 4630,
      "text": "说明咱俩的局还没完。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00004",
      "start_ms": 4950,
      "end_ms": 5990,
      "text": "酒喝干了是散场，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00005",
      "start_ms": 6090,
      "end_ms": 7050,
      "text": "剩半瓶是续集。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00006",
      "start_ms": 7170,
      "end_ms": 8735,
      "text": "您下回还得来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00007",
      "start_ms": 11930,
      "end_ms": 12750,
      "text": "你什么意思啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00008",
      "start_ms": 12750,
      "end_ms": 13150,
      "text": "怎么给我？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00009",
      "start_ms": 13150,
      "end_ms": 14050,
      "text": "这倒的这么满啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00010",
      "start_ms": 14110,
      "end_ms": 14810,
      "text": "酒满敬人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00011",
      "start_ms": 14810,
      "end_ms": 16230,
      "text": "茶满七人给您倒满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00012",
      "start_ms": 16230,
      "end_ms": 17150,
      "text": "是我对您的敬意。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00013",
      "start_ms": 17390,
      "end_ms": 18270,
      "text": "满到溢出来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00014",
      "start_ms": 20950,
      "end_ms": 21770,
      "text": "你什么意思？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00015",
      "start_ms": 22230,
      "end_ms": 23390,
      "text": "怎么最后一个敬我？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00016",
      "start_ms": 23810,
      "end_ms": 25070,
      "text": "第一个敬您是开场，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00017",
      "start_ms": 25230,
      "end_ms": 25830,
      "text": "最后一个敬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00018",
      "start_ms": 25830,
      "end_ms": 27930,
      "text": "您是压轴开场热闹压轴值前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00019",
      "start_ms": 28130,
      "end_ms": 29730,
      "text": "我把最值钱的位置留给自己了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00020",
      "start_ms": 31230,
      "end_ms": 31710,
      "text": "小李，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00021",
      "start_ms": 32130,
      "end_ms": 33310,
      "text": "你这酒量不行啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00022",
      "start_ms": 33510,
      "end_ms": 34750,
      "text": "才几杯就上脸啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00023",
      "start_ms": 35490,
      "end_ms": 36490,
      "text": "酒量留给外人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00024",
      "start_ms": 36730,
      "end_ms": 37630,
      "text": "真心留给您，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00025",
      "start_ms": 37990,
      "end_ms": 38530,
      "text": "跟您喝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00026",
      "start_ms": 38750,
      "end_ms": 39310,
      "text": "不用装，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00027",
      "start_ms": 41290,
      "end_ms": 44120,
      "text": "怎么您你给自己倒的是茶茶陪酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00028",
      "start_ms": 44240,
      "end_ms": 45260,
      "text": "一个清醒一个醉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00029",
      "start_ms": 45600,
      "end_ms": 46040,
      "text": "您醉了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00030",
      "start_ms": 46040,
      "end_ms": 46120,
      "text": "有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00031",
      "start_ms": 46120,
      "end_ms": 47140,
      "text": "我扶着我醉了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00032",
      "start_ms": 47180,
      "end_ms": 48140,
      "text": "咱俩都趴桌上了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00033",
      "start_ms": 48320,
      "end_ms": 52740,
      "text": "明早谁给您汇报这鱼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00034",
      "start_ms": 52740,
      "end_ms": 53900,
      "text": "你怎么点清蒸的呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00035",
      "start_ms": 53900,
      "end_ms": 55060,
      "text": "原汁原味才最鲜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00036",
      "start_ms": 55220,
      "end_ms": 55900,
      "text": "调料多了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00037",
      "start_ms": 56000,
      "end_ms": 57260,
      "text": "盖住的都是食材本身。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00038",
      "start_ms": 57380,
      "end_ms": 58700,
      "text": "就像您看人一眼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00039",
      "start_ms": 58700,
      "end_ms": 60175,
      "text": "到底不用包装，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00040",
      "start_ms": 61610,
      "end_ms": 63705,
      "text": "你怎么就喝这点儿养菊呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00041",
      "start_ms": 64280,
      "end_ms": 65080,
      "text": "我得留着量，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00042",
      "start_ms": 65180,
      "end_ms": 66280,
      "text": "万一您喝到位了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00043",
      "start_ms": 66280,
      "end_ms": 68975,
      "text": "总得有个清醒的人负责掏您家门钥匙吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00044",
      "start_ms": 70920,
      "end_ms": 71255,
      "text": "哈哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00045",
      "start_ms": 71590,
      "end_ms": 71885,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00046",
      "start_ms": 72190,
      "end_ms": 72990,
      "text": "你什么意思啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00047",
      "start_ms": 73110,
      "end_ms": 74595,
      "text": "怎么到我这儿就剩半杯了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00048",
      "start_ms": 74860,
      "end_ms": 75580,
      "text": "领导美满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00049",
      "start_ms": 75580,
      "end_ms": 75915,
      "text": "美满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00050",
      "start_ms": 76290,
      "end_ms": 77395,
      "text": "代表幸福美满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00051",
      "start_ms": 77620,
      "end_ms": 78440,
      "text": "这一辈子没满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00052",
      "start_ms": 78440,
      "end_ms": 79695,
      "text": "就是一辈子没满啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00053",
      "start_ms": 82570,
      "end_ms": 83550,
      "text": "第一杯你不干掉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00054",
      "start_ms": 83870,
      "end_ms": 84675,
      "text": "就是看不起我。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00055",
      "start_ms": 85230,
      "end_ms": 87690,
      "text": "领导第一杯干掉是规矩第二杯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00056",
      "start_ms": 87690,
      "end_ms": 88635,
      "text": "慢慢品才是交情，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00057",
      "start_ms": 88860,
      "end_ms": 89620,
      "text": "把规矩做足，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00058",
      "start_ms": 89620,
      "end_ms": 91375,
      "text": "后面交情再慢慢聊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00059",
      "start_ms": 92650,
      "end_ms": 93230,
      "text": "关注我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00060",
      "start_ms": 93350,
      "end_ms": 94710,
      "text": "每天学点高情商，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00061",
      "start_ms": 94730,
      "end_ms": 95410,
      "text": "说话技巧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_69c02cb2fece702a_s00062",
      "start_ms": 95650,
      "end_ms": 97275,
      "text": "让你的路越走越宽。"
    }
  ],
